"要在啟動時開啟現有專案，請加入 ``--project \"/path/project.osp\"``\\ 。成功的 JSON 回應包含 "
"``result.session_id``\\ 。請複製該值。若 OpenShot 已在執行，或您忘記 ID，請使用以下指令尋找可用工作階段::"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:174
msgid ""
"Choose the session for the project you intend to edit. You do not need to "
"start a new session for each command."
msgstr "選擇您打算編輯的專案所屬工作階段。每個指令不必都啟動新工作階段。"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:180
msgid "Selecting a session"
msgstr "選擇工作階段"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:184
msgid ""
"**Set OPENSHOT_SESSION once, then run commands normally.** Your terminal "
"remembers the selected session, so you do not need to pass ``--session`` "
"with every command. Use the PowerShell or Bash example below."
msgstr ""
"**設定 OPENSHOT_SESSION 一次，之後正常執行指令。** 您的終端機會記住所選工作階段，因此不必每次指令都帶 "
"``--session``\\ 。請參考以下 PowerShell 或 Bash 範例。"

