#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:203
msgid ""
"On macOS, use the same ``export`` syntax. For macOS or Snap commands, "
"substitute your installation's executable from Getting started. The "
"selection lasts for this terminal and commands launched from it. Set it "
"again in a new terminal, or update it when switching to a different session."
msgstr ""
"在 macOS 上，使用相同的 ``export`` 語法。對於 macOS 或 Snap "
"指令，請替換為您安裝的執行檔（參考入門說明）。此選擇會持續於此終端機及其啟動的指令。於新終端機重新設定，或切換工作階段時更新。"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:208
msgid ""
"**The remaining editing and export examples assume OPENSHOT_SESSION is "
"set.** The next subsection shows how to capture the ID automatically for "
"scripts."
msgstr "**以下編輯與匯出範例假設已設定 OPENSHOT_SESSION。** 下一小節示範如何自動擷取 ID 以供腳本使用。"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:211
msgid ""
"To target a different session for just one command, use ``--session``. It "
"overrides ``OPENSHOT_SESSION`` without changing your terminal's selection::"
msgstr ""
"若只想針對單一指令指定不同工作階段，請使用 ``--session``\\ 。此參數會覆蓋 ``OPENSHOT_SESSION``\\ "
"，但不會改變終端機的選擇::"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:216
msgid ""
"With a packaged executable, put this override after ``--cli`` and before the"
" command group: ``--cli --session OTHER_SESSION_ID project get``."
msgstr ""
"使用封裝執行檔時，將此覆蓋參數置於 ``--cli`` 之後、指令群組之前：\\ ``--cli --session OTHER_SESSION_ID "
"project get``\\ 。"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:219
msgid ""
"Automatic selection only works when exactly one reachable session exists. If"
" you see ``session_required``, run ``session list`` and explicitly select "
"the intended session. If it is no longer listed, start it again and use the "
"new ID. Help, ``intro``, and session discovery do not require a selected "
"session."
msgstr ""
"自動選擇僅在存在且可連線的工作階段唯一時有效。若看到 ``session_required``\\ ，請執行 ``session list`` "
"並明確選擇目標工作階段。若不再列出，請重新啟動並使用新 ID。說明、\\ ``intro`` 與工作階段發現不需選擇工作階段。"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:225
msgid "Capturing the session ID automatically"
msgstr "自動擷取工作階段 ID"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:227
msgid ""
"Scripts can read ``result.session_id`` directly from the JSON returned by "
"``session start`` and set ``OPENSHOT_SESSION`` for subsequent commands. "
"There is no need to copy the ID manually or read a log file. Check that "
"startup succeeded before using the returned ID."
msgstr ""
"腳本可直接從 ``session start`` 回傳的 JSON 中讀取 ``result.session_id``\\ ，並設定 "
"``OPENSHOT_SESSION`` 以供後續指令使用。無需手動複製 ID 或讀取日誌檔。使用回傳 ID 前請確認啟動成功。"

